{"id": "EUVD-2026-78413", "enisaUuid": "3694e190-4083-3f68-a32b-a9143ed9c965", "description": "Steedos Platform through 3.0.15-beta.47 contains a reflected cross-site scripting vulnerability in the anonymous /api/page/render endpoint that fails to properly escape query parameters in inline script elements. Attackers can craft malicious links with script-terminating sequences in the schemaApi or data parameters to execute arbitrary JavaScript in victim sessions and steal X-Auth-Token credentials.", "datePublished": "2026-09-15T11:00:50", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-24T14:22:27", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/steedos/steedos-platform/issues/8354", "https://github.com/steedos/steedos-platform", "https://github.com/steedos/steedos-platform/blob/044423a3f326d86cf17f0e45adcbd44d2d3b06dd/services/service-pages/main/default/routes/page_render.router.js", "https://github.com/steedos/steedos-platform/blob/044423a3f326d86cf17f0e45adcbd44d2d3b06dd/services/service-pages/main/default/routes/page_view.ejs", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/steedos-platform-through-3.0.15-beta.47-reflected-xss-via-page-render"], "aliases": ["GHSA-925g-q5h8-6rmx", "CVE-2026-91922"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.34, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "5690a8f6-3220-3a29-a3e2-ac06c04b6335", "product": {"name": "steedos-platform", "vendor": {"name": "steedos"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.0.15-beta.47"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "9ad4a350-bae9-368d-a36a-a7a8aa017f46", "vendor": {"name": "steedos"}}], "isExploited": false}